{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02970","headline":"九月九日登龙山 · 张九龄","name":"九月九日登龙山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郡庭常窘束，凉野求昭旷。\n楚客凛秋时，桓公旧台上。\n清明风日好，历落江山望。\n极远何萧条，中留坐惆怅。\n东弥夏首阔，西拒荆门壮。\n夷险虽异时，古今岂殊状。\n先贤杳不接，故老犹可访。\n投吊伤昔人，挥斤感前匠。\n自爲本疎散，未始忘幽尚。\n际会非有欲，往来是无妄。\n爲邦复多幸，去国殊迁放。\n且泛篱下菊，还聆郢中唱。\n灌园亦何爲，於陵乃逃相。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02970.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02970","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}